{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Guac &amp; Load</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Guac &amp; Load</i> is a fast-paced restaurant sim where chaos in the kitchen turns into a fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 Start Your Shift</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook rice, beans, and meats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make some guac and stock your trays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build burrito bowls for customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run the register and keep the line moving</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udddf But Watch Out...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some customers can get aggressive, must be\u00a0the Z-Coli\u00a0outbreak!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab kitchen tools or the guac gun to fight back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive furious ex-customers and keep the restaurant alive</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf00 Gameplay Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each shift starts calm\u2014just another day behind the counter. But after a while, everything changes. The pressure builds. The music shifts. The customers? Not so friendly anymore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2705 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buying, cooking, chopping different types of food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Preparing customer's orders. A customer has a specific order that you must fulfill, you get money based on how accurate your order is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zombies (infected by Z-Coli) will come and you'll need to fight to survive.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800880?t=1749855673","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/0b661c4cba67c907834d9f4f117ef3a4a59f205a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749855673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta